# Chatbot - the assistant: greets, offers suggestions, “thinks”, writes the answer live (with Stop), can carry an
# action button inside the answer (onAction gets its label), rated with 👍 / 👎. answers: {match (regex), text, action,
# primary}; the one without match is the fallback.
#   Chatbot(title: "Rober", greeting: "Hi, I'm Rober…", suggestions: @ideas, answers: @answers, onAction: act)
# avatar: an image, a logo or a GIF url in place of the drawn face (“/logo.svg”, “/rober.gif”).
# demo "on": it taps its own suggestions in turn and answers them live, for a landing; the first touch stops it.
# shadcn-for-muten · part over KitWidget (kit core).
part Chatbot(title: text, greeting: text, suggestions: list, answers: list, demo: text = "", avatar: text = "", onAction: action) {
  Custom KitWidget inputs(name: "chatbot", title: $title, greeting: $greeting, suggestions: $suggestions, answers: $answers, demo: $demo, avatar: $avatar) on(action: $onAction) class("cx-bot")
}
